[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3960.23, "timestamp": "01:06:00", "text": "圣诞老人，这对我意义重大。是的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3962.95, "timestamp": "01:06:02", "text": "祝你好运。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3966.309, "timestamp": "01:06:06", "text": "可以尽情享受幸福。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3968.47, "timestamp": "01:06:08", "text": "是的。我的意思是，只有你一个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3971.91, "timestamp": "01:06:11", "text": "来找我，就像沙布什一样，因为每个人都"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3974.069, "timestamp": "01:06:14", "text": "否则就进行调整。他们学到了一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3976.549, "timestamp": "01:06:16", "text": "他们现在也不介意我了。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3979.589, "timestamp": "01:06:19", "text": "不要拿我的健康开玩笑。所以我就想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3982.069, "timestamp": "01:06:22", "text": "只要你提起我，我都会很高兴。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3984.63, "timestamp": "01:06:24", "text": "有时我觉得我来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3986.47, "timestamp": "01:06:26", "text": "只是想和你一起出去玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3989.349, "timestamp": "01:06:29", "text": "一点。就像这样，我就可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3992.23, "timestamp": "01:06:32", "text": "比如，“嗨，sa，让我稍微打扰一下。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3996.309, "timestamp": "01:06:36", "text": "有点儿，你知道，就是些很蠢的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3998.95, "timestamp": "01:06:38", "text": "因为为什么不呢？”所以，是的，我这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4000.95, "timestamp": "01:06:40", "text": "我就像会说，“圣诞老人，你……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4002.63, "timestamp": "01:06:42", "text": "你忙吗？因为我有这样的情况"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4004.23, "timestamp": "01:06:44", "text": "我的芭蕾舞裙出了点问题。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4005.549, "timestamp": "01:06:45", "text": "“好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4008.39, "timestamp": "01:06:48", "text": "瓦莱兰特，再见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4011.75, "timestamp": "01:06:51", "text": "是的，这对我意义重大，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4013.67, "timestamp": "01:06:53", "text": "惊人的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4014.91, "timestamp": "01:06:54", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4016.75, "timestamp": "01:06:56", "text": "是的。"}]